Date:</strong> {{ $json.due_date }}</p>\n<p><strong>Payment Terms:</strong> {{ $json.customer.payment_terms }}</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 20px 0;\"><a href=\"{{ $env.PAYMENT_PORTAL_URL }}/pay/{{ $json.invoice_id }}\" style=\"background: #4CAF50; color: white; padding: 12px 24px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 4px;\">Pay Now</a></p>\n\n<p>Thank you for your business!</p>\n</div>",
